1017d42b73c7e7e.webp?t=1659096773\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/6374b71d1f8dce88d55564094565fd61.webp?t=1659096773\" /></div><br>On your way, you will find stone human statues that will show you all kinds of stories from human life. Observe them and, with the goddess\u2019 help, draw conclusions that will allow you to better understand human emotions and behaviors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.poster.avif?t=1659096773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.webm?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.mp4?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/e2744bb831d29d5391017d42b73c7e7e.webp?t=1659096773\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/fdb4657acd05feeb332b87be19908cdc.webp?t=1659096773\" /></div><br>Your journey will teach you about human lives, logic, and emotions. But it will also give you a chance to fill the world with life and beauty, casting your light over the empty lands. Explore as much as you want, and find all the little things that make this world unique.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dfa265351d7c7953f360b9b164445e9c.poster.avif?t